extract":"Rebecca Bennett is an American healthcare executive and former Navy helicopter pilot who is the U.S. representative-elect for New Jersey's 7th congressional district. A member of the Democratic Party, Bennett defeated Republican incumbent Thomas Kean Jr. in the 2026 election.","extract_html":"<p><b>Rebecca Bennett</b> is an American healthcare executive and former Navy helicopter pilot who is the U.S. representative-elect for New Jersey's 7th congressional district. A member of the Democratic Party, Bennett defeated Republican incumbent Thomas Kean Jr. in the 2026 election.</p>"}